  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Based Violence (GBV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA&apos;s Gender-based Violence (GBV) programme aims to address a human rights violations that affect women and girls disproportionately and aims to change harmful social norms and gender inequality. The program also aims at improving the access to SRHR  services as a basic human right to be available to all people especially women and young girls throughout their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
